          "Follow Me To Nellie's",
          "2011",
          "",
          "Follow me to Nellie's premiered at Premiere Stages, Kean University Zella Fry Theatre in North New Jersey in July 2011 under the direction of John Wooten. [ 22 ] [ 23 ]"
